# Scratch / probe / ad-hoc test artefacts. The codebase is treated as a
# golden public copy; every transient curl probe, repro script, dump
# file, or tempfile redirect must stay local. Patterns below cover the
# shapes that have leaked into history before:
#   - `.tmp_*` — dotfile probes from session loops
#   - `tmp_*.{py,ps1,json,sh,txt}` — ad-hoc throwaway scripts
#   - `_*.py`, `_*.json`, `_*.txt` — underscore-prefixed scratch
#     (e.g. `_drift_audit.py`, `_repro_webhook.py`, `_uat_probe.py`)
#   - `Userssarka*` and `C*UserssarkaApp*` — mangled-tempfile artefacts
#     from PowerShell redirects when $env:TEMP wasn't honoured
#   - `*_resp.json`, `*_probe.txt`, `agent_drift.json`, `build_agent.json`,
#     `create_agent.json` — single-shot API probe outputs
.tmp_*
.tmp*/
tmp_*.py
tmp_*.ps1
tmp_*.sh
tmp_*.json
tmp_*.txt
_audit_*.py
_drift_*.py
_long_pipe*
_repro_*.py
_ssrf_*.py
_tmp_*
_uat_*.py
_verify_*.py
Userssarka*
agent_drift.json
build_agent.json
builder_page.html
create_agent.json
create_agent_resp.json
drift_alerts.json
drift_config.json
exec_*.json
execs*.json
full_id.txt
login.json
openapi_dump.json
pipe_replay.json
replay*.json
response_probe.txt
test_db.py
uat_jobid.txt
verify_audit.py
verify_audit_out.json

